OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says abuse 'crossed
OL,4,Aa line'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader said abuse and
OL,7,Fintimidation directed at councillors
OL,8,Fover a controversial aviary closure had
OL,9,F"crossed a line".
OL,11,FSefton Council leader Marion Atkinson
OL,12,Fsaid offensive comments, threats and
OL,13,Fthe publication of her personal details
OL,14,Fonline had gone too far.
OL,16,FAtkinson said she had been left "sad,
OL,17,Ffrustrated, annoyed and angry" by the
OL,18,Fabuse.
